What Does Ceramic Coating Do for Your Car?
What ceramic coating does is one of the most common questions people have before booking the service. In simple terms, it forms a hard, bonded layer over your car's paint that adds protection and shine.
Creates a hydrophobic layer that repels water and dirt
Adds a glossy, deep finish to the paint
